    "page_content": "1. Purpose\nThis policy defines approval authority levels for booking Order Intake and establishes requirements for Order Backlog\nmonitoring. This version supersedes v1.0 as part of the FY2025 controls enhancement program.\n2. Scope\nApplies to all Orders booked as Order Intake and to periodic review of Order Backlog balances.\n3. Approval Authority Matrix",
